1
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:12,000
"Echo Of A Letter"
(Episode 13)

2
00:00:12,023 --> 00:00:16,510
[Longevity, a character
often seen at birthday parties]

3
00:00:17,760 --> 00:00:19,280
Congratulations, Master Chen.

4
00:00:20,600 --> 00:00:21,799
You're looking so spirited.

5
00:00:21,879 --> 00:00:22,879
Tell me about it.

6
00:00:22,920 --> 00:00:25,159
Rongxin's stock has been rising lately.

7
00:00:25,239 --> 00:00:26,839
Isn't that only natural?

8
00:00:27,359 --> 00:00:27,680
Thank you.

9
00:00:27,760 --> 00:00:28,760
Good, good.

10
00:00:29,359 --> 00:00:30,119
Fourth Young Master.

11
00:00:30,199 --> 00:00:31,655
Next time you need
anything, just say the word.

12
00:00:31,679 --> 00:00:32,679
Sure, no problem.

13
00:00:33,799 --> 00:00:35,479
Let's look out for each other from now on.

14
00:00:38,920 --> 00:00:39,440
Let me take this call first.

15
00:00:39,520 --> 00:00:40,039
Please excuse me.

16
00:00:40,119 --> 00:00:41,279
Go right ahead.

17
00:00:41,358 --> 00:00:44,038
This is Young Mr. Chen's first
appearance at a formal family event.

18
00:00:44,209 --> 00:00:45,056
[Zhao Shengge]

19
00:00:45,152 --> 00:00:47,632
He used to be an illegitimate child,
and now he's the Fourth Young Master.

20
00:00:52,320 --> 00:00:53,520
Chen Wan!

21
00:00:53,600 --> 00:00:54,679
You played me!

22
00:00:54,759 --> 00:00:55,480
Waiter.

23
00:00:55,560 --> 00:00:57,959
Bring me a copy of today's
Harbor Evening News.

24
00:00:58,039 --> 00:00:59,455
You tricked me into
buying up retail shares.

25
00:00:59,479 --> 00:01:00,816
Then you bought the
dip when the price fell,

26
00:01:00,840 --> 00:01:02,296
teaming up with the market
makers to rig the market.

27
00:01:02,320 --> 00:01:03,360
Are you trying to ruin me?

28
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:06,400
Then I hope you plug this
financial hole soon, Mr. Liao,

29
00:01:06,480 --> 00:01:07,680
and save White Crane Hall.

30
00:01:10,040 --> 00:01:11,439
Believe me,

31
00:01:11,492 --> 00:01:12,709
I'll leak those photos of yours—

32
00:01:12,760 --> 00:01:13,320
Go ahead.

33
00:01:13,400 --> 00:01:15,040
Though before you do,

34
00:01:15,120 --> 00:01:16,959
I suggest you read today's
Harbor Evening News.

35
00:01:16,983 --> 00:01:18,157
[Taiji's new opening brings
the rich Haishi families out]

36
00:01:18,519 --> 00:01:21,480
My mother and Meng Yuanxiong
of Taiji were business partners.

37
00:01:21,560 --> 00:01:22,880
They started a business together.

38
00:01:24,519 --> 00:01:25,639
You played me!

39
00:01:25,719 --> 00:01:27,560
Back up your claims with evidence.

40
00:01:27,640 --> 00:01:28,999
Maliciously inducing trades,

41
00:01:29,079 --> 00:01:30,399
leaking confidential information,

42
00:01:30,439 --> 00:01:31,616
manipulating the stock market—

43
00:01:31,640 --> 00:01:33,415
any one of those will
land you in deep trouble.

44
00:01:33,439 --> 00:01:35,656
Just wait for the Securities
Commission to penalize you!

45
00:01:35,680 --> 00:01:36,960
Don't trouble yourself.

46
00:01:37,040 --> 00:01:39,040
I've already received their warning.

47
00:01:47,159 --> 00:01:48,959
Go have a drink with your father in a bit.

48
00:01:49,560 --> 00:01:50,560
No need.

49
00:01:51,439 --> 00:01:52,320
Come on.

50
00:01:52,400 --> 00:01:53,480
It's his birthday.

51
00:01:53,560 --> 00:01:54,799
Hurry and go toast him.

52
00:01:54,879 --> 00:01:55,359
Hurry.

53
00:01:55,439 --> 00:01:56,439
Fine.

54
00:02:01,280 --> 00:02:03,320
Tonight's guest is very
important. Fill your glass.

55
00:02:04,480 --> 00:02:06,040
It's time you helped the family.

56
00:02:06,560 --> 00:02:08,839
Once we secure that
tobacco shipping route of his,

57
00:02:08,919 --> 00:02:11,000
the Chen family's power
will expand considerably.

58
00:02:11,080 --> 00:02:12,800
Has Rongxin really fallen this far?

59
00:02:13,960 --> 00:02:15,760
Even if you make me sell myself,

60
00:02:15,840 --> 00:02:18,239
I'm afraid it still won't
bring it back from the dead.

61
00:02:18,319 --> 00:02:20,519
It's just a toast, basic social courtesy.

62
00:02:20,599 --> 00:02:22,000
What nonsense are you spouting?

63
00:02:22,879 --> 00:02:23,519
Hey.

64
00:02:23,599 --> 00:02:24,840
Old Chen,

65
00:02:28,159 --> 00:02:30,600
why the grim face?

66
00:02:30,680 --> 00:02:31,519
It's nothing.

67
00:02:31,599 --> 00:02:32,320
All right, all right.

68
00:02:32,400 --> 00:02:33,040
Don't get upset.

69
00:02:33,120 --> 00:02:34,120
Careful.

70
00:02:34,919 --> 00:02:35,959
Where's my fine liquor?

71
00:02:36,039 --> 00:02:37,399
Top me up.

72
00:02:37,479 --> 00:02:39,360
I keep it on hand for you at all times.

73
00:02:39,960 --> 00:02:43,280
Rongbaozhai's Da Fugui
has a rich, savory aroma.

74
00:02:43,879 --> 00:02:44,960
Here, Uncle Xu.

75
00:02:45,639 --> 00:02:46,480
Cheers.

76
00:02:46,560 --> 00:02:47,799
Wan.

77
00:02:47,879 --> 00:02:49,679
Have a drink with Uncle Xu.

78
00:02:49,759 --> 00:02:50,760
From now on,

79
00:02:50,840 --> 00:02:52,119
for Rongxin Tobacco,

80
00:02:52,199 --> 00:02:54,000
I'll have your back.

81
00:02:54,080 --> 00:02:58,000
Stick with the right person
and you won't stumble.

82
00:02:58,080 --> 00:02:58,760
Yes, indeed.

83
00:02:58,840 --> 00:03:02,320
We won't trouble you with
the tobacco business, Boss Xu.

84
00:03:02,400 --> 00:03:04,160
Rongxin has other plans.

85
00:03:04,240 --> 00:03:05,680
What nonsense are you talking about?

86
00:03:06,560 --> 00:03:07,440
Wan.

87
00:03:07,520 --> 00:03:09,359
Today is your father's birthday.

88
00:03:09,439 --> 00:03:10,839
It's just a toast.

89
00:03:10,919 --> 00:03:12,880
Back when your mother was young,

90
00:03:12,960 --> 00:03:14,960
she had to toast Uncle Xu too.

91
00:03:15,680 --> 00:03:16,680
Did you know that?

92
00:03:16,759 --> 00:03:19,520
And back then, it wasn't
as simple as just drinking.

93
00:03:20,240 --> 00:03:22,639
Wan, you're a sensible kid.

94
00:03:22,719 --> 00:03:24,200
Don't be picky.

95
00:03:24,280 --> 00:03:25,855
What difference does it
make who you're with?

96
00:03:25,879 --> 00:03:29,359
No need for such suggestive
remarks, First Madam.

97
00:03:29,439 --> 00:03:31,639
None of those things
were my mother's choice.

98
00:03:31,719 --> 00:03:34,000
Your husband forced her to do them.

99
00:03:36,039 --> 00:03:38,920
If my mother hadn't put on a smile
to entertain guests all those years,

100
00:03:39,000 --> 00:03:40,520
would he be worth what he is today?

101
00:03:41,400 --> 00:03:42,160
Second Madam,

102
00:03:42,240 --> 00:03:44,599
he used to trade away his
women, and now his children.

103
00:03:45,120 --> 00:03:48,200
Chen Baoyi just turned sixteen this year.

104
00:03:48,280 --> 00:03:49,160
You'd better watch out.

105
00:03:49,240 --> 00:03:50,440
You—.

106
00:03:50,520 --> 00:03:51,656
What nonsense are you spouting?

107
00:03:51,680 --> 00:03:52,680
You insolent brat!

108
00:04:49,399 --> 00:04:50,520
You left this in my office.

109
00:04:50,600 --> 00:04:52,640
I called you earlier, you
probably didn't hear it.

110
00:04:52,720 --> 00:04:53,720
Thank you.

111
00:04:55,279 --> 00:04:56,279
Mr. Zhao.

112
00:04:57,120 --> 00:04:58,680
What brings you here?

113
00:04:59,199 --> 00:05:01,199
I assumed having an
invitation meant I could come.

114
00:05:01,480 --> 00:05:02,480
Yes, yes, of course.

115
00:05:03,800 --> 00:05:06,759
Your presence graces
Rongxin Manor, Mr. Zhao.

116
00:05:07,319 --> 00:05:08,879
We couldn't be more delighted.

117
00:05:08,959 --> 00:05:10,216
If our hospitality falls short in any way,

118
00:05:10,240 --> 00:05:11,520
please don't hold it against us.

119
00:05:12,639 --> 00:05:13,639
Is this drink yours?

120
00:05:16,360 --> 00:05:17,360
No.

121
00:05:21,120 --> 00:05:21,600
Mr. Zhao,

122
00:05:21,680 --> 00:05:23,640
this drink was my toast
to Young Master Chen.

123
00:05:23,720 --> 00:05:24,720
Then drink it yourself.

124
00:05:29,439 --> 00:05:30,439
Okay.

125
00:05:42,240 --> 00:05:43,240
Keep drinking.

126
00:05:58,360 --> 00:05:59,399
Have another.

127
00:06:04,160 --> 00:06:05,360
Pour him another glass.

128
00:06:09,519 --> 00:06:10,519
Keep going.

129
00:06:26,079 --> 00:06:27,079
Want to head back?

130
00:06:28,839 --> 00:06:30,719
Or do you want to stay
and have a bit more fun?

131
00:06:31,720 --> 00:06:32,760
Let's go. Let's head back.

132
00:06:39,959 --> 00:06:40,959
Wan, you—

133
00:06:44,600 --> 00:06:45,759
Mr. Chen.

134
00:06:45,839 --> 00:06:47,896
Minglong's project is about
to hold its public launch.

135
00:06:47,920 --> 00:06:49,119
As Minglong's

136
00:06:49,199 --> 00:06:51,319
personally invited technical
consultant and director,

137
00:06:52,000 --> 00:06:53,480
Chen Wan's schedule will be packed.

138
00:06:54,079 --> 00:06:56,960
Without my personal
permission and approval,

139
00:06:57,040 --> 00:06:58,600
he won't have the time.

140
00:06:59,680 --> 00:07:00,680
If you want Chen Wan,

141
00:07:01,519 --> 00:07:02,519
come to me first.

142
00:07:15,319 --> 00:07:16,640
Master!

143
00:07:16,720 --> 00:07:17,720
Dad!

144
00:07:39,040 --> 00:07:40,040
Zhao Shengge.

145
00:07:41,439 --> 00:07:42,560
It's going to rain.

146
00:07:46,639 --> 00:07:47,639
Zhao Shengge,

147
00:07:49,680 --> 00:07:50,999
are you

148
00:07:51,079 --> 00:07:52,240
mad at me?

149
00:07:55,560 --> 00:07:58,160
When did you start planning all of this?

150
00:07:58,680 --> 00:08:00,079
In such a short span of time,

151
00:08:00,680 --> 00:08:01,960
every single piece

152
00:08:02,040 --> 00:08:03,600
fell seamlessly into place.

153
00:08:03,680 --> 00:08:05,480
Handled with breathtaking precision.

154
00:08:06,079 --> 00:08:07,240
Truly brilliant.

155
00:08:10,839 --> 00:08:11,839
Ever since Liao Quan

156
00:08:12,639 --> 00:08:15,040
used my mother to threaten me.

157
00:08:16,519 --> 00:08:17,519
Chen Wan.

158
00:08:20,040 --> 00:08:22,319
You built Kexiang from the ground up.

159
00:08:23,879 --> 00:08:24,879
Was it hard work?

160
00:08:25,920 --> 00:08:26,640
What?

161
00:08:26,720 --> 00:08:28,079
Building Kexiang?

162
00:08:30,920 --> 00:08:32,240
Of course it was.

163
00:08:32,320 --> 00:08:34,200
Then why did you withdraw
from the partnership?

164
00:08:37,000 --> 00:08:38,760
I only withdrew as a partner,

165
00:08:38,840 --> 00:08:41,599
but I'll keep following
through on upcoming projects.

166
00:08:41,679 --> 00:08:43,759
Besides, I was a silent partner anyway,

167
00:08:45,440 --> 00:08:46,855
so it doesn't really make much difference.

168
00:08:46,879 --> 00:08:47,879
Is it because of me?

169
00:08:49,159 --> 00:08:50,159
No.

170
00:08:52,559 --> 00:08:53,639
Not entirely.

171
00:08:58,200 --> 00:08:59,200
Withdrawing from Kexiang

172
00:08:59,960 --> 00:09:01,719
means whatever happens down the line,

173
00:09:01,799 --> 00:09:03,120
it won't affect Minglong.

174
00:09:03,639 --> 00:09:05,720
Because Minglong signed with Kexiang,

175
00:09:06,320 --> 00:09:07,320
not Chen Wan.

176
00:09:08,919 --> 00:09:11,120
Quite the clever calculation
on your part, though.

177
00:09:11,759 --> 00:09:13,720
You, Chen Wan, can walk away anytime.

178
00:09:16,320 --> 00:09:17,320
I'm sorry.

179
00:09:17,840 --> 00:09:18,840
I'm sorry.

180
00:09:19,840 --> 00:09:20,840
Sorry for what?

181
00:09:22,039 --> 00:09:23,840
For causing trouble for you and Minglong.

182
00:09:24,559 --> 00:09:24,920
Haven't you

183
00:09:25,000 --> 00:09:26,799
already eliminated all that trouble?

184
00:09:27,759 --> 00:09:29,960
Minglong hasn't been
affected at all so far.

185
00:09:31,080 --> 00:09:33,559
The crisis over the photos
and scandals is resolved.

186
00:09:34,159 --> 00:09:36,600
White Crane Hall will never make a comeback.

187
00:09:37,480 --> 00:09:40,120
Rongxin is marching step
by step toward its ruin.

188
00:09:40,679 --> 00:09:43,015
And the Securities Commission
probably can't touch you either.

189
00:09:43,039 --> 00:09:44,039
Chen Wan,

190
00:09:44,759 --> 00:09:46,200
what else aren't you satisfied with?

191
00:09:49,320 --> 00:09:50,679
I'm still a liability.

192
00:09:53,799 --> 00:09:55,559
How much further do
you intend to take this?

193
00:10:00,480 --> 00:10:02,600
As far as I possibly can.

194
00:10:06,639 --> 00:10:07,639
Chen Wan.

195
00:10:08,759 --> 00:10:10,559
Do you remember what I told you?

196
00:10:15,279 --> 00:10:17,519
I told you to stop treating
me like an ornament.

197
00:10:22,440 --> 00:10:23,440
I'm sorry.

198
00:10:39,519 --> 00:10:40,519
Chen Wan,

199
00:10:43,159 --> 00:10:45,080
do you really want to be with me?

200
00:10:50,759 --> 00:10:52,240
I don't think you do.

201
00:10:54,679 --> 00:10:55,919
Not in the way I understand it—

202
00:10:55,960 --> 00:10:57,000
being together openly,

203
00:10:57,600 --> 00:10:58,679
for the long haul,

204
00:10:59,240 --> 00:11:01,240
and with complete honesty.

205
00:11:01,320 --> 00:11:02,040
No.

206
00:11:02,120 --> 00:11:03,600
That's not true, Zhao Shengge.

207
00:11:04,799 --> 00:11:06,199
I really do like you.

208
00:11:06,279 --> 00:11:08,120
I really want to be with you.

209
00:11:08,200 --> 00:11:09,839
With a clean slate and nothing to hide.

210
00:11:09,919 --> 00:11:11,679
I don't want that kind of relationship.

211
00:11:12,960 --> 00:11:14,039
I don't like it.

212
00:11:20,519 --> 00:11:21,519
Zhao Shengge...

213
00:11:22,759 --> 00:11:24,919
Can I still pursue you, then?

214
00:11:25,960 --> 00:11:26,960
Chen Wan,

215
00:11:28,919 --> 00:11:30,279
you're very smart.

216
00:11:31,519 --> 00:11:32,559
When you pursue me,

217
00:11:32,639 --> 00:11:35,000
you observe what I like to eat,

218
00:11:35,879 --> 00:11:37,400
what I like to drink,

219
00:11:37,480 --> 00:11:39,279
and what I want to do at any given time.

220
00:11:40,840 --> 00:11:43,159
But what if I hide myself away?

221
00:11:45,080 --> 00:11:47,959
From that point on, you wouldn't know my mood,

222
00:11:48,039 --> 00:11:49,040
my habits,

223
00:11:49,120 --> 00:11:50,320
or my thoughts.

224
00:11:51,200 --> 00:11:52,319
Chen Wan,

225
00:11:52,399 --> 00:11:53,600
do you want to try that?

226
00:11:55,840 --> 00:11:58,080
I think I'm probably even
better at hiding than you are.

227
00:12:00,399 --> 00:12:01,600
Don't be sad,

228
00:12:04,279 --> 00:12:05,879
because that's exactly how you treat me.

229
00:12:13,840 --> 00:12:15,639
You put up a Christmas tree for me.

230
00:12:17,480 --> 00:12:19,080
Caught fireflies for me.

231
00:12:21,159 --> 00:12:23,319
Sent me peonies and hydrangeas.

232
00:12:23,399 --> 00:12:24,855
You said you hoped I'd always be happy.

233
00:12:24,879 --> 00:12:26,159
Let me tell you, Chen Wan.

234
00:12:27,759 --> 00:12:28,799
Lately,

235
00:12:32,559 --> 00:12:34,080
I haven't felt very happy.

236
00:12:35,440 --> 00:12:37,279
Today is my saddest day.

237
00:12:44,159 --> 00:12:45,159
Growing up,

238
00:12:47,519 --> 00:12:49,199
I felt it was hard for me to get

239
00:12:49,279 --> 00:12:51,840
the kind of effortless joy others had.

240
00:12:53,720 --> 00:12:54,960
When I got a little older,

241
00:12:55,759 --> 00:12:57,519
I realized even being loved was hard.

242
00:12:59,600 --> 00:13:00,600
And now?

243
00:13:04,200 --> 00:13:05,879
I don't even have a shred of trust.

244
00:13:09,360 --> 00:13:10,360
Zhao Shengge...

245
00:13:11,279 --> 00:13:13,320
Can I still pursue you?

246
00:13:17,120 --> 00:13:18,120
Better forget it.

247
00:13:27,240 --> 00:13:28,240
Zhao Shengge,

248
00:13:29,039 --> 00:13:30,440
may I pursue you?

249
00:13:59,080 --> 00:14:00,080
Chen Wan.

250
00:14:01,240 --> 00:14:03,360
If you don't know how to
pursue someone, stop trying.

251
00:14:03,799 --> 00:14:04,799
Zhao Shengge...

252
00:14:08,879 --> 00:14:09,879
Let me do it.

253
00:14:14,759 --> 00:14:16,639
You really have no clue
how to pursue someone.

254
00:14:17,559 --> 00:14:19,479
No matter how much I
teach you, you never learn.

255
00:14:20,240 --> 00:14:21,279
So let me take over.

256
00:14:29,639 --> 00:14:30,639
Coming over?

257
00:14:39,840 --> 00:14:41,159
Did I say you could hug me?

258
00:14:43,559 --> 00:14:44,799
Zhao Shengge,

259
00:14:44,879 --> 00:14:46,399
may I hug you?

260
00:14:57,799 --> 00:14:58,799
Chen Wan.

261
00:14:59,600 --> 00:15:00,920
I won't ask to break up with you.

262
00:15:01,679 --> 00:15:04,399
But I'll treat you the
exact way you treat me.

263
00:15:05,559 --> 00:15:07,000
Keep one thing from me,

264
00:15:07,080 --> 00:15:08,320
and I'll keep ten from you.

265
00:15:09,039 --> 00:15:09,839
Keep ten things from me,

266
00:15:09,919 --> 00:15:11,239
and I'll keep a hundred from you.

267
00:15:11,799 --> 00:15:13,839
Eventually, all those
secrets will push us apart,

268
00:15:13,919 --> 00:15:15,120
and in the end, we'll be done.

269
00:15:16,679 --> 00:15:17,679
Chen Wan,

270
00:15:18,600 --> 00:15:19,919
do you want us to end?

271
00:15:29,080 --> 00:15:30,399
You messed up this badly,

272
00:15:30,919 --> 00:15:31,959
and you're the one crying?

273
00:15:35,360 --> 00:15:36,599
If I pursue you,

274
00:15:36,679 --> 00:15:38,080
I'm doing it my way.

275
00:15:38,720 --> 00:15:39,720
Do you promise?

276
00:15:41,879 --> 00:15:42,880
When I pursue someone,

277
00:15:42,960 --> 00:15:44,800
I don't sneak around
in a secret relationship.

278
00:15:44,840 --> 00:15:45,840
Do you accept that?

279
00:15:47,759 --> 00:15:48,759
When I pursue someone,

280
00:15:50,480 --> 00:15:51,839
there's none of that martyrdom

281
00:15:51,919 --> 00:15:53,200
or self-sacrifice nonsense.

282
00:15:53,840 --> 00:15:54,880
Shared benefits,

283
00:15:54,960 --> 00:15:56,120
equal risks.

284
00:15:56,200 --> 00:15:57,200
Do you agree?

285
00:15:58,399 --> 00:15:59,040
Zhao Shengge,

286
00:15:59,120 --> 00:16:00,120
I agree to all of it.

287
00:16:02,039 --> 00:16:03,039
Chen Wan,

288
00:16:04,360 --> 00:16:06,160
you're a repeat offender with me.

289
00:16:06,240 --> 00:16:07,599
Taking advantage of my feelings.

290
00:16:07,679 --> 00:16:08,439
I really can't

291
00:16:08,519 --> 00:16:09,679
trust you so easily anymore.

292
00:16:12,639 --> 00:16:13,639
Swear it.

293
00:16:16,879 --> 00:16:18,280
If Chen Wan does it again,

294
00:16:18,360 --> 00:16:20,879
Zhao Shengge will never be
happy or get his wish again.

295
00:16:22,120 --> 00:16:22,839
No.

296
00:16:22,919 --> 00:16:23,919
Don't.

297
00:16:25,120 --> 00:16:26,280
The heavens already heard it.

298
00:16:26,799 --> 00:16:27,919
You've already made the vow.

299
00:16:41,080 --> 00:16:42,080
Chen Wan,

300
00:16:43,559 --> 00:16:46,120
do this again, and I
really will lock you up.

301
00:16:51,720 --> 00:16:52,720
Zhao Shengge,

302
00:16:53,480 --> 00:16:55,439
do you really like me that much?

303
00:16:55,519 --> 00:16:57,240
You can take it as

304
00:16:58,360 --> 00:16:59,360
love.

305
00:17:00,600 --> 00:17:02,360
Take it as I love you,

306
00:17:02,440 --> 00:17:03,440
Chen Wan.

307
00:17:08,960 --> 00:17:09,960
Otherwise, how could I

308
00:17:10,000 --> 00:17:12,079
let the same person fool
me so many times in a row?

309
00:17:14,680 --> 00:17:15,920
Zhao Shengge,

310
00:17:16,000 --> 00:17:17,319
I loved you first.

311
00:17:18,279 --> 00:17:19,479
I love you the most.

312
00:17:19,559 --> 00:17:20,640
I know.

313
00:17:20,720 --> 00:17:22,039
I believe you have more right

314
00:17:22,119 --> 00:17:23,840
than anyone in the world to say that.

315
00:17:23,920 --> 00:17:25,120
You don't know.

316
00:17:25,200 --> 00:17:25,920
Okay.

317
00:17:26,000 --> 00:17:27,160
I don't know, so tell me.

318
00:17:27,240 --> 00:17:28,640
Tell me about it, okay?

319
00:17:35,400 --> 00:17:36,440
My Chen Wan

320
00:17:37,880 --> 00:17:39,400
really is a big crybaby.

321
00:17:40,599 --> 00:17:42,359
Zhao Shengge, I'm sorry.

322
00:17:47,880 --> 00:17:48,880
What's wrong?

323
00:17:50,200 --> 00:17:51,440
Why are you apologizing again?

324
00:17:54,160 --> 00:17:55,199
I'm sorry.

325
00:17:55,279 --> 00:17:56,279
I'm sick.

326
00:17:58,839 --> 00:18:01,119
Are you apologizing
just for taking medicine?

327
00:18:05,839 --> 00:18:06,839
Here.

328
00:18:07,440 --> 00:18:08,959
Everyone gets sick,

329
00:18:09,039 --> 00:18:10,039
right?

330
00:18:13,200 --> 00:18:14,400
Thank you.

331
00:18:14,480 --> 00:18:15,480
Thank you.

332
00:18:17,720 --> 00:18:19,480
All right, stop crying.

333
00:18:21,359 --> 00:18:22,799
There, there. Be good.

334
00:18:32,279 --> 00:18:33,279
Chen Wan,

335
00:18:33,839 --> 00:18:34,839
look.

336
00:18:36,440 --> 00:18:37,679
Do you think that bird

337
00:18:37,759 --> 00:18:39,319
saw you crying just now?

338
00:18:39,960 --> 00:18:41,360
Better not let it see.

339
00:18:41,440 --> 00:18:42,440
Thirty years old

340
00:18:42,480 --> 00:18:43,360
and still shedding tears.

341
00:18:43,440 --> 00:18:45,680
There's no rule saying
you can't cry at thirty.

342
00:18:46,759 --> 00:18:48,199
As far as I'm concerned,

343
00:18:48,279 --> 00:18:49,799
you can cry even when you're sixty.

344
00:18:55,000 --> 00:18:56,000
Chen Wan,

345
00:18:57,039 --> 00:18:58,719
back during your days at the Chen house...

346
00:19:02,519 --> 00:19:04,239
The Chen family had a kennel

347
00:19:04,319 --> 00:19:05,800
with three Siberian Huskies

348
00:19:05,880 --> 00:19:07,119
and a Bernese Mountain Dog.

349
00:19:07,960 --> 00:19:09,640
I lived in there for a year and a half.

350
00:19:11,359 --> 00:19:13,039
Right before I went to Xiaolanshan.

351
00:19:15,319 --> 00:19:16,319
Zhao Shengge,

352
00:19:18,079 --> 00:19:20,119
do you pity me a little right now?

353
00:19:22,319 --> 00:19:23,720
I don't pity you.

354
00:19:25,079 --> 00:19:26,640
If I had to put a word to it,

355
00:19:27,480 --> 00:19:29,720
I hope you'll understand it as tenderness,

356
00:19:30,400 --> 00:19:31,400
and cherishing you.

357
00:19:37,279 --> 00:19:38,759
You don't need to pity me, though.

358
00:19:40,000 --> 00:19:42,000
Because I gave them plenty of trouble.

359
00:19:43,640 --> 00:19:44,959
By the end,

360
00:19:45,039 --> 00:19:47,680
it was hard to tell who
tormented whom more.

361
00:19:48,960 --> 00:19:50,480
Besides, it was back then

362
00:19:51,039 --> 00:19:52,399
that I met you for the first time.

363
00:19:52,880 --> 00:19:54,279
Though you probably forgot.

364
00:19:57,119 --> 00:19:58,119
When was that?

365
00:20:00,440 --> 00:20:02,319
It was my third year after being sent in.

366
00:20:03,000 --> 00:20:04,920
Liao Quan still wouldn't
let me go in the end,

367
00:20:05,519 --> 00:20:07,320
so I escaped.

368
00:20:07,400 --> 00:20:09,079
They sent a lot of people after me.

369
00:20:13,799 --> 00:20:15,439
I had a fever at the time,

370
00:20:15,519 --> 00:20:16,800
completely delirious from it.

371
00:20:16,880 --> 00:20:18,440
All I knew was to keep walking forward,

372
00:20:18,920 --> 00:20:21,440
until I reached the orphanage
next to the psychiatric hospital.

373
00:20:22,039 --> 00:20:25,039
That day, you happened to be at
the Xiaolanshan Phase Two orphanage

374
00:20:25,119 --> 00:20:26,279
attending a charity event.

375
00:20:26,359 --> 00:20:27,719
I ran into you.

376
00:20:27,799 --> 00:20:29,919
You thought I was one of
the kids from the orphanage.

377
00:20:30,119 --> 00:20:32,200
Running around blindly, I
stumbled into your lounge

378
00:20:34,920 --> 00:20:35,719
because through the window,

379
00:20:35,799 --> 00:20:37,239
I saw a fruit knife on the table.

380
00:20:37,319 --> 00:20:38,959
You were resting your eyes at the time.

381
00:20:39,039 --> 00:20:41,079
Woken up by me, you
looked at me for a moment.

382
00:20:56,559 --> 00:20:58,600
You thought I wanted fruit,

383
00:20:58,680 --> 00:21:00,279
so you casually handed me a mangosteen.

384
00:21:02,119 --> 00:21:03,839
I had a fever and tonsillitis.

385
00:21:04,559 --> 00:21:06,160
My throat hurt terribly,

386
00:21:06,240 --> 00:21:07,640
and I hadn't spoken in a long time.

387
00:21:08,559 --> 00:21:09,600
I originally thought

388
00:21:09,680 --> 00:21:11,400
I'd never make it out of Xiaolanshan alive.

389
00:21:11,599 --> 00:21:13,399
And even if I did, it'd
just be another cage.

390
00:21:13,759 --> 00:21:15,039
But...

391
00:21:15,119 --> 00:21:16,119
But what?

392
00:21:18,279 --> 00:21:19,880
Back then, I thought to myself,

393
00:21:21,440 --> 00:21:23,440
I hadn't come over to ask your name yet.

394
00:21:25,839 --> 00:21:26,839
I wanted to say,

395
00:21:28,079 --> 00:21:29,079
"Thank you.

396
00:21:30,039 --> 00:21:31,599
May I ask what your name is?"

397
00:21:35,680 --> 00:21:36,759
My name is Zhao Shengge.

398
00:21:38,440 --> 00:21:39,799
Hello, Zhao Shengge.

399
00:21:40,440 --> 00:21:41,440
My name is Chen Wan.

400
00:21:46,519 --> 00:21:48,519
May I ask if you'd be with me?

401
00:21:48,599 --> 00:21:49,719
Do I not need to pursue you?

402
00:21:52,200 --> 00:21:53,200
Well,

403
00:21:55,200 --> 00:21:56,200
you still should.

404
00:21:58,920 --> 00:22:00,440
I take things pretty seriously.

405
00:22:01,039 --> 00:22:02,359
Pursuing someone is no different.

406
00:22:03,240 --> 00:22:04,999
You should have everything others have,

407
00:22:05,079 --> 00:22:07,000
and only even more than anyone else.

408
00:22:09,000 --> 00:22:10,960
Think it over carefully
before you answer me.

409
00:22:12,240 --> 00:22:13,240
Zhao Shengge,

410
00:22:15,319 --> 00:22:17,000
may I ask why?

411
00:22:20,079 --> 00:22:21,079
Chen Wan,

412
00:22:24,000 --> 00:22:25,160
being drawn to you

413
00:22:25,680 --> 00:22:27,680
was a subtle yet inevitable process.

414
00:22:29,119 --> 00:22:30,119
Chen Wan,

415
00:22:30,839 --> 00:22:33,160
no one in this world could dislike you.

416
00:22:34,200 --> 00:22:37,000
Still, I don't like you
just because you like me.

417
00:22:38,720 --> 00:22:40,759
You don't need to go looking for

418
00:22:41,319 --> 00:22:42,559
one specific reason.

419
00:22:45,119 --> 00:22:46,640
You yourself are the answer.

420
00:23:03,880 --> 00:23:05,160
Let's go.

421
00:23:05,240 --> 00:23:06,240
Let's head home.

422
00:23:26,480 --> 00:23:27,920
That time at the casino,

423
00:23:28,000 --> 00:23:29,279
did you notice me?

424
00:23:31,720 --> 00:23:32,720
I don't recall.

425
00:23:34,759 --> 00:23:37,240
A Rolls-Royce took my
parking spot that day.

426
00:23:40,240 --> 00:23:42,279
It's about time you got a new car anyway.

427
00:23:42,359 --> 00:23:43,919
I'll take you to pick one out tomorrow.

428
00:23:52,000 --> 00:23:53,000
Why did we come here?

429
00:23:53,640 --> 00:23:55,696
We staked out the Zhao, Shen,
and Tan places with no luck.

430
00:23:55,720 --> 00:23:56,960
Surely we can catch him here.

431
00:23:57,839 --> 00:23:58,600
Hey, look!

432
00:23:58,680 --> 00:23:59,600
That car!

433
00:23:59,680 --> 00:24:01,719
I've seen it in Minglong's
underground garage.

434
00:24:01,799 --> 00:24:02,600
No way.

435
00:24:02,680 --> 00:24:04,015
I'll chase him to the ends
of the earth to find him.

436
00:24:04,039 --> 00:24:05,159
Keep waiting.

437
00:24:07,519 --> 00:24:08,519
Come on in.

438
00:24:15,200 --> 00:24:16,200
They're brand new.

439
00:24:19,319 --> 00:24:20,319
I've got it.

440
00:24:32,680 --> 00:24:33,800
It's not a big place.

441
00:24:33,880 --> 00:24:34,759
Make yourself at home.

442
00:24:34,839 --> 00:24:36,039
Once I have money,

443
00:24:36,119 --> 00:24:37,200
I'll buy you a big house.

444
00:24:38,640 --> 00:24:39,640
Do you have money?

445
00:24:41,039 --> 00:24:42,039
I can earn it.

446
00:24:46,960 --> 00:24:47,840
Make yourself comfortable.

447
00:24:47,920 --> 00:24:48,920
I'll pour you some tea.

448
00:25:56,960 --> 00:25:57,960
I didn't steal it.

449
00:25:59,880 --> 00:26:00,880
After your exam,

450
00:26:00,960 --> 00:26:02,119
you threw it in the trash.

451
00:26:04,119 --> 00:26:05,240
I didn't call you a thief.

452
00:26:06,359 --> 00:26:07,359
What about this?

453
00:26:09,720 --> 00:26:10,759
Can you tell me about it?

454
00:26:10,839 --> 00:26:13,600
That's from your last local league match.

455
00:26:13,680 --> 00:26:15,679
Maybe you felt the main
campus courts and gym

456
00:26:15,759 --> 00:26:16,799
had too many spectators,

457
00:26:17,640 --> 00:26:20,160
so you went over to the Shaw
Building on the branch campus.

458
00:26:21,160 --> 00:26:22,519
Around that time,

459
00:26:22,599 --> 00:26:24,479
I happened to be studying
in the Shaw Building.

460
00:26:25,079 --> 00:26:26,720
You went to watch me play every day?

461
00:26:28,279 --> 00:26:29,719
Still, I really just picked this up.

462
00:26:31,759 --> 00:26:33,120
I'd never steal your things.

463
00:26:33,200 --> 00:26:34,200
It's okay.

464
00:26:35,160 --> 00:26:37,920
Why didn't you think of
returning the ball to me?

465
00:26:40,240 --> 00:26:40,599
Look.

466
00:26:41,119 --> 00:26:42,679
There's a dent in it.

467
00:26:42,759 --> 00:26:44,239
I figured you didn't want it anymore.

468
00:26:45,000 --> 00:26:46,920
I wasn't going to bother you

469
00:26:47,000 --> 00:26:48,240
over something you didn't want.

470
00:26:50,279 --> 00:26:51,279
Chen Wan,

471
00:26:52,319 --> 00:26:53,879
you're quite good at picking things up.

472
00:26:55,119 --> 00:26:57,519
Keep at it, and now you've picked
me up and brought me home.

473
00:27:03,319 --> 00:27:04,880
You bought the cufflinks for me too?

474
00:27:08,720 --> 00:27:10,079
Last time we were on Bei Island,

475
00:27:11,000 --> 00:27:12,000
they caught my eye.

476
00:27:13,519 --> 00:27:15,279
You even fought me for them back then.

477
00:27:15,359 --> 00:27:17,079
Though I was buying them for you anyway.

478
00:27:18,039 --> 00:27:19,080
If you had wanted them,

479
00:27:19,160 --> 00:27:20,320
I would've let you have them.

480
00:27:22,119 --> 00:27:23,680
I thought they were for a friend.

481
00:27:29,880 --> 00:27:31,279
I don't have that many friends.

482
00:27:33,839 --> 00:27:34,879
What about the wool scarf?

483
00:27:37,039 --> 00:27:38,480
When we video chatted before,

484
00:27:39,240 --> 00:27:42,039
I saw your balcony was made of marble.

485
00:27:42,119 --> 00:27:43,519
I worried it might be too chilly,

486
00:27:44,400 --> 00:27:45,640
especially during typhoons,

487
00:27:46,960 --> 00:27:48,400
so I bought it for you.

488
00:27:49,200 --> 00:27:51,000
I really didn't want you getting sick.

489
00:27:53,920 --> 00:27:55,160
Why?

490
00:27:55,240 --> 00:27:56,920
Why buy so many things for me?

491
00:28:00,240 --> 00:28:01,640
I don't know why either.

492
00:28:02,880 --> 00:28:04,240
I just wanted to buy them for you.

493
00:28:08,319 --> 00:28:10,759
It felt like a solo

494
00:28:11,440 --> 00:28:12,480
treasure hunt.

495
00:28:18,799 --> 00:28:19,840
And this too.

496
00:28:19,920 --> 00:28:21,120
I spotted this watch last time

497
00:28:21,200 --> 00:28:22,799
when we bought the cufflinks together.

498
00:28:23,559 --> 00:28:25,440
You didn't seem very interested,

499
00:28:25,960 --> 00:28:27,360
so I went back on my own to buy it.

500
00:28:27,680 --> 00:28:29,680
Still, these are all just
based on my own taste.

501
00:28:30,240 --> 00:28:31,599
It's fine if you don't like them.

502
00:28:32,200 --> 00:28:34,640
Whatever you want, I'll buy it for you.

503
00:28:36,599 --> 00:28:38,039
You'll buy whatever I want?

504
00:28:41,519 --> 00:28:42,720
And this bottle of cologne.

505
00:28:46,079 --> 00:28:47,359
Look at this cologne.

506
00:28:49,480 --> 00:28:50,400
Last time,

507
00:28:50,480 --> 00:28:51,480
after our video call,

508
00:28:52,079 --> 00:28:54,079
seeing your home decor reminded me of it.

509
00:29:00,039 --> 00:29:01,119
And this bottle of wine.

510
00:29:02,480 --> 00:29:04,720
I saw how much you
enjoyed it at the reception,

511
00:29:05,519 --> 00:29:07,160
so I went and bought a bottle afterward.

512
00:29:08,759 --> 00:29:10,679
I don't know if you'd
consider bidding on these.

513
00:29:11,240 --> 00:29:12,679
I'm not sure if you'll like them.

514
00:29:12,759 --> 00:29:13,759
I really don't know...

515
00:29:22,319 --> 00:29:23,319
Chen Wan,

516
00:29:24,720 --> 00:29:25,839
I love them.

517
00:29:27,799 --> 00:29:29,400
Then would you consider bidding on them?

518
00:29:31,559 --> 00:29:33,359
Not only am I bidding on them,

519
00:29:34,119 --> 00:29:35,216
I want you to put them on me,

520
00:29:35,240 --> 00:29:37,200
every single one of them.

521
00:30:14,279 --> 00:30:15,600
Zhao Shengge,

522
00:30:15,680 --> 00:30:16,680
your kindness

523
00:30:17,240 --> 00:30:18,240
is so sexy.

524
00:30:21,325 --> 00:30:22,525
You even bought me ear studs?

525
00:30:23,039 --> 00:30:24,279
Too bad my ears aren't pierced.

526
00:30:28,759 --> 00:30:29,320
Though,

527
00:30:29,400 --> 00:30:30,640
I can get them pierced for you.

528
00:30:31,079 --> 00:30:32,360
Don't.

529
00:30:32,440 --> 00:30:33,440
No way.

530
00:30:33,480 --> 00:30:34,199
It'll hurt.

531
00:30:34,279 --> 00:30:35,120
Chen Wan,

532
00:30:35,200 --> 00:30:36,775
what gives you the right
to withhold my gifts?

533
00:30:36,799 --> 00:30:38,199
I almost never got to receive them.

534
00:30:39,000 --> 00:30:40,400
Zhao Shengge,

535
00:30:40,480 --> 00:30:42,600
from now on, I'll buy
you lots and lots of things.

536
00:30:42,680 --> 00:30:44,079
Even better ones.

537
00:31:13,039 --> 00:31:15,560
Tech Moguls' Rising Star
Secretly Meets Same-Sex Friend,

538
00:31:15,640 --> 00:31:17,719
Inseparable for Two Days and Three Nights.

539
00:31:17,799 --> 00:31:18,600
Lately,

540
00:31:18,680 --> 00:31:19,600
Reporters are still
calling him a rising star?

541
00:31:19,680 --> 00:31:20,680
Seriously?

542
00:31:20,759 --> 00:31:22,120
Hear me out first.

543
00:31:22,200 --> 00:31:22,840
It says right here

544
00:31:22,920 --> 00:31:24,575
the same person was seen going
home with him three days straight,

545
00:31:24,599 --> 00:31:26,440
side by side, holding hands!

546
00:31:27,839 --> 00:31:28,320
Mr. Tan!

547
00:31:28,400 --> 00:31:29,400
Mr. Tan!

548
00:31:38,240 --> 00:31:39,240
Zhao Shengge!

549
00:31:39,960 --> 00:31:41,040
What's the meaning of this?

550
00:31:43,279 --> 00:31:44,400
Hey!

551
00:31:44,480 --> 00:31:45,400
Zhao Shengge, if you want to fool around,

552
00:31:45,480 --> 00:31:47,095
there are plenty of
people out there for you.

553
00:31:47,119 --> 00:31:48,479
Not Chen Wan, though.

554
00:31:48,559 --> 00:31:50,199
He's not some unwanted nobody.

555
00:31:50,279 --> 00:31:51,359
He's my buddy!

556
00:31:52,119 --> 00:31:53,119
Fool around?

557
00:31:54,000 --> 00:31:55,000
Fool around with what?

558
00:31:56,720 --> 00:31:57,840
Are the two of you together?

559
00:31:58,440 --> 00:31:59,440
Not yet.

560
00:32:00,279 --> 00:32:01,279
I'm pursuing him.

561
00:32:04,519 --> 00:32:05,759
You actually pursue people?

562
00:32:12,160 --> 00:32:14,680
So this is your attitude
toward my love life?

563
00:32:15,759 --> 00:32:17,279
What attitude am I supposed to have?

564
00:32:17,359 --> 00:32:19,959
Do you think Chen Wan's easy to
push around because he's gentle?

565
00:32:20,039 --> 00:32:21,039
Zhixuan, stop!

566
00:32:21,079 --> 00:32:22,079
He still has us!

567
00:32:22,119 --> 00:32:23,200
I don't think that.

568
00:32:24,920 --> 00:32:26,079
I'm serious about him.

569
00:32:28,720 --> 00:32:29,720
You'd better be.

570
00:32:45,920 --> 00:32:46,679
Zhixuan,

571
00:32:46,759 --> 00:32:47,759
hold on.

572
00:32:54,759 --> 00:32:56,120
Shengge,

573
00:32:56,200 --> 00:32:57,519
I'm already miserable enough.

574
00:32:57,599 --> 00:32:58,880
My family froze my cards

575
00:32:59,519 --> 00:33:00,959
and took my cars.

576
00:33:01,039 --> 00:33:01,479
I...

577
00:33:01,559 --> 00:33:03,079
I can only bum rides off them now.

578
00:33:04,519 --> 00:33:06,600
If your family gives you a hard time,

579
00:33:06,680 --> 00:33:07,720
let me know anytime.

580
00:33:10,279 --> 00:33:11,359
You don't blame me?

581
00:33:12,799 --> 00:33:14,640
He can burn the whole
place down if he wants.

582
00:33:15,319 --> 00:33:16,720
I just want the right to know.

583
00:33:18,599 --> 00:33:19,599
Zhao...

584
00:33:20,720 --> 00:33:21,720
Shengge?

585
00:33:22,799 --> 00:33:23,679
Zhixuan.

586
00:33:23,759 --> 00:33:24,920
What are they talking about?

587
00:33:25,000 --> 00:33:27,680
Thank you for looking out for Chen
Wan for me these past few years.

588
00:33:27,720 --> 00:33:28,920
Don't mention it.

589
00:33:29,640 --> 00:33:30,880
Still,

590
00:33:30,960 --> 00:33:32,000
don't let it happen again.

591
00:33:45,839 --> 00:33:46,560
Zhixuan,

592
00:33:46,640 --> 00:33:47,720
did Zhao Shengge scold you?

593
00:33:49,279 --> 00:33:50,120
No.

594
00:33:50,200 --> 00:33:51,200
Serves you right.

595
00:33:53,960 --> 00:33:55,079
He didn't scold me!

596
00:33:56,559 --> 00:33:57,360
Hey.

597
00:33:57,440 --> 00:33:59,120
The kid got scolded silly.

598
00:33:59,200 --> 00:33:59,959
Let go!

599
00:34:00,039 --> 00:34:01,239
Sit tight.

600
00:34:01,319 --> 00:34:02,359
Who are you calling silly?

601
00:34:03,279 --> 00:34:03,959
It's fine.

602
00:34:04,039 --> 00:34:05,359
Chen Wan's even sillier than you.

603
00:34:06,680 --> 00:34:09,119
Long-standing firm Rongxin's
stock has surged repeatedly

604
00:34:09,199 --> 00:34:10,479
amid rumors of a takeover.

605
00:34:10,559 --> 00:34:12,199
In response, a Rongxin Group spokesperson

606
00:34:12,239 --> 00:34:13,559
at today's press conference

607
00:34:13,639 --> 00:34:15,199
made the following statement:

608
00:34:16,519 --> 00:34:17,920
Faced with this hostile takeover,

609
00:34:18,000 --> 00:34:19,495
we will not sit back
and wait for our demise.

610
00:34:19,519 --> 00:34:20,519
We will initiate...

611
00:34:21,400 --> 00:34:23,376
The shares acquired from
the minority shareholders

612
00:34:23,400 --> 00:34:24,400
have cleared.

613
00:34:25,039 --> 00:34:27,400
I now hold over half of Rongxin's shares.

614
00:34:29,079 --> 00:34:30,519
Today's shareholders' meeting

615
00:34:31,079 --> 00:34:32,079
is sure to go smoothly.

616
00:34:33,480 --> 00:34:34,480
This time,

617
00:34:35,280 --> 00:34:37,800
I'll send the Chen family to hell myself.

618
00:34:38,360 --> 00:34:42,000
I must be the one to drive this knife in.

619
00:34:42,559 --> 00:34:43,559
Up to you.

620
00:34:44,199 --> 00:34:45,736
Do whatever it takes,
burn it all down if you want.

621
00:34:45,760 --> 00:34:46,760
Just let me know.

622
00:34:48,000 --> 00:34:49,000
Okay.

623
00:35:14,639 --> 00:35:15,400
Everyone,

624
00:35:15,480 --> 00:35:16,559
before the meeting begins,

625
00:35:16,639 --> 00:35:18,280
I have an announcement to make.

626
00:35:21,159 --> 00:35:22,599
Mr. Chen Wan's shareholding

627
00:35:22,679 --> 00:35:24,000
has reached 52%,

628
00:35:24,599 --> 00:35:27,400
making him the company's
largest shareholder.

629
00:35:27,480 --> 00:35:28,976
In accordance with regulations, the board

630
00:35:29,000 --> 00:35:30,639
has initiated a personnel change plan

631
00:35:30,719 --> 00:35:33,400
and registered Mr. Chen
Wan as a shareholder.

632
00:35:33,480 --> 00:35:36,480
This change does not restructure the board.

633
00:35:37,800 --> 00:35:39,360
The existing strategy committee

634
00:35:39,440 --> 00:35:42,079
and audit committee
functions remain unaffected.

635
00:35:42,159 --> 00:35:44,000
Please welcome Mr. Chen Wan.

636
00:35:45,960 --> 00:35:48,119
Based on this change in equity ownership,

637
00:35:48,199 --> 00:35:49,199
Mr. Chen Bingxin

638
00:35:49,239 --> 00:35:51,280
has lost his veto power.

639
00:35:51,360 --> 00:35:52,360
From now on,

640
00:35:52,440 --> 00:35:54,760
any major company decisions

641
00:35:54,840 --> 00:35:56,039
will be decided by me

642
00:35:56,119 --> 00:35:57,400
and executed by the board.

643
00:35:59,159 --> 00:36:00,320
Rongxin

644
00:36:00,400 --> 00:36:02,079
was founded single-handedly by me!

645
00:36:02,159 --> 00:36:03,999
No one knows it better than me,

646
00:36:04,079 --> 00:36:05,440
or has more say than me!

647
00:36:06,599 --> 00:36:08,079
Using cheap tricks,

648
00:36:08,159 --> 00:36:09,760
lying and cheating!

649
00:36:09,840 --> 00:36:11,079
You don't know a thing!

650
00:36:12,440 --> 00:36:13,840
Who are you to boss us around?

651
00:36:14,480 --> 00:36:16,479
Even a founder must obey the law.

652
00:36:16,559 --> 00:36:18,840
Decisions that violate
corporate law are invalid.

653
00:36:18,920 --> 00:36:20,240
I hope Chairman Chen understands

654
00:36:20,320 --> 00:36:21,320
times have changed.

655
00:36:21,920 --> 00:36:23,039
From now on,

656
00:36:23,119 --> 00:36:25,800
the board will no longer
be your one-man show.

657
00:36:27,480 --> 00:36:28,480
Mutiny!

658
00:36:37,039 --> 00:36:37,559
Wake up!

659
00:36:37,639 --> 00:36:40,479
Chen's 30-Year Empire
Sinks in Central Harbor.

660
00:36:40,559 --> 00:36:43,480
Rongxin Falls to Taiji and Gets Carved Up.

661
00:36:44,039 --> 00:36:46,200
Haishi's long-standing Rongxin Group

662
00:36:46,280 --> 00:36:48,559
witnessed a dramatic change of control.

663
00:36:48,639 --> 00:36:49,240
We're here.

664
00:36:49,320 --> 00:36:50,416
Previously absent from
many public gatherings,

665
00:36:50,440 --> 00:36:51,880
Chen Bingxin's fourth son, Chen Wan,

666
00:36:51,960 --> 00:36:53,439
has become the new head of Rongxin.

667
00:36:53,519 --> 00:36:54,439
Are you holding up okay?

668
00:36:54,519 --> 00:36:56,079
Meanwhile, founder Chen Bingxin

669
00:36:56,159 --> 00:36:56,680
I'm fine.

670
00:36:56,760 --> 00:36:58,456
and several directors, over
suspected equity irregularities...

671
00:36:58,480 --> 00:37:00,599
Rongxin is completely fractured right now.

672
00:37:00,679 --> 00:37:02,280
I have to wipe them out completely,

673
00:37:02,360 --> 00:37:03,920
or there will be endless trouble later.

674
00:37:04,920 --> 00:37:05,920
Alright.

675
00:37:10,400 --> 00:37:11,400
It suits you well.

676
00:37:14,519 --> 00:37:16,880
As for Ge Xi pushing
for the share transfer,

677
00:37:16,960 --> 00:37:18,599
it's fine to take your time.

678
00:37:19,440 --> 00:37:20,559
Doing it in stages is best.

679
00:37:21,400 --> 00:37:22,920
If circumstances allow,

680
00:37:23,000 --> 00:37:25,039
your mom could also
step in where appropriate.

681
00:37:25,960 --> 00:37:26,360
Of course,

682
00:37:26,440 --> 00:37:28,200
that's just a suggestion.

683
00:37:28,280 --> 00:37:29,280
You decide.

684
00:37:36,320 --> 00:37:37,400
Don't drop me off tomorrow.

685
00:37:38,079 --> 00:37:39,079
Get some extra sleep.

686
00:37:40,199 --> 00:37:41,679
That's no way to pursue someone.

687
00:37:43,719 --> 00:37:45,039
Then stop pursuing me

688
00:37:45,119 --> 00:37:46,119
and make it official.

689
00:37:46,880 --> 00:37:47,880
No.

690
00:37:47,920 --> 00:37:48,920
I haven't passed yet.

691
00:37:50,440 --> 00:37:51,440
What more does it take?

692
00:37:55,559 --> 00:37:56,960
I haven't done well enough.

693
00:37:58,559 --> 00:38:00,039
How is it not good enough?

694
00:38:00,119 --> 00:38:01,119
Zhao Shengge,

695
00:38:02,559 --> 00:38:05,439
you've barely left my side lately.

696
00:38:05,519 --> 00:38:06,959
You couldn't possibly be any better.

697
00:38:07,519 --> 00:38:08,519
Chen Wan,

698
00:38:09,239 --> 00:38:10,840
are you comparing me to other people?

699
00:38:11,639 --> 00:38:12,639
What do you mean?

700
00:38:13,599 --> 00:38:14,999
If you're going to compare me,

701
00:38:15,079 --> 00:38:16,639
compare me to yourself.

702
00:38:16,719 --> 00:38:17,960
You set the standard.

703
00:38:18,880 --> 00:38:20,639
Because my standard is Chen Wan,

704
00:38:21,360 --> 00:38:22,880
I'm always one step behind.

705
00:38:25,320 --> 00:38:26,479
In that case,

706
00:38:26,559 --> 00:38:28,720
whether you've won me over is up to you?

707
00:38:28,800 --> 00:38:30,439
It's up to you.

708
00:38:30,519 --> 00:38:31,840
However,

709
00:38:31,920 --> 00:38:33,320
going easy on me wouldn't be right.

710
00:38:37,719 --> 00:38:39,000
It's almost time.

711
00:38:47,440 --> 00:38:48,800
Zhao Shengge,

712
00:38:48,880 --> 00:38:49,920
I won't go easy on you.

713
00:38:50,440 --> 00:38:51,880
Even though it's not official yet,

714
00:38:52,880 --> 00:38:55,239
surely a kiss first is allowed, right?

715
00:38:57,760 --> 00:38:58,760
It is.

716
00:39:20,079 --> 00:39:20,559
Hey, hey!

717
00:39:20,639 --> 00:39:22,079
Hold on, let me see.

718
00:39:23,480 --> 00:39:24,896
Didn't you fail to get a front shot too?

719
00:39:24,920 --> 00:39:26,000
Yeah.

720
00:39:27,800 --> 00:39:29,215
Forget it, maybe it's better we didn't.

721
00:39:29,239 --> 00:39:30,240
What if we published it

722
00:39:30,320 --> 00:39:31,959
and someone like Zhao Shengge caught us?

723
00:39:32,039 --> 00:39:34,519
Wouldn't we end up just like Mak Ka Fai?

724
00:39:35,719 --> 00:39:36,719
Gentlemen,

725
00:39:37,360 --> 00:39:38,479
have some water.

726
00:39:38,559 --> 00:39:39,800
No, no, we're good.

727
00:39:40,679 --> 00:39:42,639
Compliments of our young master.

728
00:39:42,719 --> 00:39:43,719
Okay, thank you.

729
00:39:44,440 --> 00:39:45,680
By the way,

730
00:39:45,760 --> 00:39:47,200
did you get any good shots?

731
00:39:47,280 --> 00:39:48,519
Man, we didn't get anything.

732
00:39:56,159 --> 00:39:57,679
That makes things tricky.

733
00:40:06,760 --> 00:40:07,760
Hello, Special Assistant?

734
00:40:08,559 --> 00:40:09,879
They didn't get any shots at all.

735
00:40:10,440 --> 00:40:11,519
That's going to be tough.

736
00:40:11,599 --> 00:40:13,079
Mr. Zhao specifically asked for this.

737
00:40:13,880 --> 00:40:16,559
Then get a few more media outlets on it.

738
00:40:16,639 --> 00:40:17,639
Got it.

739
00:40:19,360 --> 00:40:21,159
That meeting totally wiped me out.

740
00:40:22,639 --> 00:40:23,639
Shen Zongnian,

741
00:40:23,719 --> 00:40:24,719
I want a feast.

742
00:40:25,239 --> 00:40:26,816
There's a pretty good Thai place lately.

743
00:40:26,840 --> 00:40:27,680
Want to try it?

744
00:40:27,760 --> 00:40:28,119
Sure,

745
00:40:28,679 --> 00:40:29,679
let's go there.

746
00:40:29,739 --> 00:40:30,826
[I'm almost done over here]

747
00:40:31,219 --> 00:40:32,339
[Same here]

748
00:40:32,800 --> 00:40:33,720
Zhao Shengge,

749
00:40:33,800 --> 00:40:34,800
are you coming?

750
00:40:35,179 --> 00:40:36,359
[I'm finished]

751
00:40:37,559 --> 00:40:38,959
Hello?

752
00:40:39,039 --> 00:40:40,439
Are you done?

753
00:40:40,519 --> 00:40:41,816
Looks like it's going to rain outside.

754
00:40:41,840 --> 00:40:43,119
Don't come pick me up.

755
00:40:43,199 --> 00:40:44,319
I'll just take a cab to you.

756
00:40:44,360 --> 00:40:45,240
No need.

757
00:40:45,320 --> 00:40:46,320
Wait for me.

758
00:40:48,679 --> 00:40:49,800
I'm not going.

759
00:40:49,880 --> 00:40:51,080
I have to go pick up Chen Wan.

760
00:40:52,159 --> 00:40:54,240
If the rain gets in your way,

761
00:40:54,320 --> 00:40:55,800
you can order in and eat at Minglong.

762
00:40:57,280 --> 00:40:58,400
Zhao Shengge,

763
00:40:58,480 --> 00:40:59,560
it's about to rain outside.

764
00:40:59,639 --> 00:41:01,119
Just send your driver to pick him up.

765
00:41:02,679 --> 00:41:04,159
My driver isn't the one pursuing him.

766
00:41:08,199 --> 00:41:08,800
Let's go.

767
00:41:08,880 --> 00:41:09,880
Just the two of us.

768
00:41:23,719 --> 00:41:25,800
The 0659 model chip has been discontinued.

769
00:41:26,440 --> 00:41:28,360
Then build one that
supports continuous updates.

770
00:41:43,986 --> 00:41:45,041
Everything over at Xiaolanshan

771
00:41:45,079 --> 00:41:46,439
has been arranged.

772
00:41:46,519 --> 00:41:47,240
Good.

773
00:41:47,320 --> 00:41:48,320
Got it.

774
00:41:48,960 --> 00:41:49,960
Thanks.
